24
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,850
I, Wang Lin, have a principle.

25
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:55,690
Purple Division
Heavenly Fate Sect

26
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,890
If one doesn't mess with me,

27
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,450
I won't mess with them.

28
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,650
But if someone dares to mess with me

29
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,730
I will destroy them !

30
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,610
You disrespectful brat !

31
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,530
How dare you act recklessly

32
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,490
on this joyous day of our Heavenly Fate Sect !?

33
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,450
Earth Shard !

34
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,930
You've provoked me twice now.

35
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,370
If I don't kill you,

36
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,850
I am not Wang Lin.

37
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,130
Demonic flames  !

38
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,690
What ?!

39
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,490
How is this possible ?!

40
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,490
Seventh Brother,

41
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:58,250
this is Master’s birthday.

42
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,130
There are many fellow cultivators here !

43
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,330
Don't act recklessly !

44
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,650
Outsiders of the Heavenly Fate Sect

45
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,090
will not interfere

46
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,050
in this internal strife.

47
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,370
Seventh Brother,

48
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,450
