53
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,450
or not !

54
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,850
Heaven and Earth Mantra of Freedom !

55
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,650
This is Master's birthday.

56
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,330
You wouldn't dare to kill me !

57
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,050
You won't kill me !

58
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,130
Wang Lin,

59
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,010
you dared to kill a direct disciple !?

60
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,650
He's too bold !

61
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,410
Indeed...

62
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,130
It's your turn now.

63
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,650
Wang Lin broke the sect rules

64
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,690
by killing a disciple !

65
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,250
Where are the Disciplinary Elders ?

66
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:16,290
Whoever stands in my way

67
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,650
is my enemy !

68
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,090
This...

69
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,690
You guys !

70
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,650
Fourth Sister !

71
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,690
I already repaid

72
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,530
the favor I owed you.

73
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,770
Give me a good reason

74
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,050
to intervene.

75
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,690
Fine !

76
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,650
Fine !

77
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,930
I wanted to save this for the competition...

78
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,370
But we will

79
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,890
settle this now with a fight to the death !

80
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,290
Master actually planted a demon seed inside him !?

81
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,970
That's unfair !

82
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,490
This is bad !

83
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,010
What is that !?

84
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,170
God Slaying Chariot,

85
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,250
activate !

86
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:08,330
Stop this at once !

87
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,410
What are you even fighting for ?

88
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,850
You didn't even let me finish my wine...

89
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,290
Greetings

90
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,130
Uncle Chi Lie.

91
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,410
Calling me Uncle won't save you.

92
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:38,330
You forcefully used the demon seed before it was ready.

93
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,970
Your Master said

94
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,370
that you are banned from participating

95
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,810
in the competition.

96
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,170
No...

97
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,050
Impossible !

98
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,170
I cultivated 1000 years for this !

99
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,410
Disciple

100
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,650
obeys...

101
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,650
Little guy,

102
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,650
without the demon seed

103
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,050
you would have won.

104
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,930
Not bad !

105
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:07,090
The position of Violet Son of Tian Yun is vacant.

106
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,610
Your Master

107
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,930
has high hopes for you.

108
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,530
The Juniors of the Violet Division just caused a ruckus,

109
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:17,170
and ruined the mood.

110
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,090
I hope everyone will forgive us.

111
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,090
Tomorrow,

112
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:23,570
my Senior Brother the All-Seer will give a lecture on the Dao.

113
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:26,010
I hope everyone will benefit from it

114
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,050
and make this event worth your time.

115
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:34,930
So that ghost was an Ancient Demon,

116
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:37,650
it gave me the same feeling as an Ancient God.

117
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,930
What was that spell ?

118
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:40,850
Seventh Brother !

119
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:44,250
It seems the title Son of Tian Yun is within your grasp.

120
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:47,730
Let me toast to your success in advance.

121
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:50,250
This is the Teleportation spell I promised.

122
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,530
I originally planned to give it to you

123
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,930
after Master's birthday.

124
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,650
Besides the Teleportation Spell, this jade slip

125
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,090
also contains a Forbidden Spell created by Master.

126
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,170
I give them both to you

127
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:03,490
as an apology for what happened a month ago.

128
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,290
Young friend !

129
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,170
The younger generation is formidable !

130
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,730
Fellow cultivator,

131
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,850
let's toast to your success !

132
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,570
Purple Forest Pavilion

133
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:33,850
This Teleportation spell is very powerful.

134
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,890
I crossed 10 000 li

135
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,090
in an instant.

136
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:43,090
The Forbidden Spell recorded in the jade slip,

137
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,970
the Nine Cycles Celestial Refining Tactic,

138
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,570
is used to transform celestial spiritual energy

139
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,570
into golden celestial spiritual energy.

140
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:51,050
I painstakingly circulated it for 5 hours

141
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,690
but I'm only at the third cycle.

142
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:56,090
Unfortunately, the two types of celestial spiritual energy are incompatible.

143
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:58,770
I will store it in my left hand for now.

144
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,890
The day of the lecture

145
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,850
has finally arrived.

146
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:14,250
Main Palace of the
Heavenly Fate Sect

147
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,890
I heard the Violet Division is the weakest

148
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,730
and lacks talent.

149
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,490
It seems it's true.

150
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,650
Keep your voice down !

151
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,890
Silence.

152
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,530
Late stage Soul Transformation...

153
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,810
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...

154
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,650
Half-step Ascendant ?

155
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:01,250
On planet Tian Yun, just the disciples

156
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,290
of any single division

157
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,330
could sweep planet Suzaku.

158
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,650
We pay respects to the All-Seer !

159
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,650
We pay respects to Master !

160
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,650
I am the All-Seer.

161
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,050
I cultivated for tens of thousands of years

162
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,330
and glimpsed at the Dao of the heavens.

163
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,170
In this lecture on the Dao,

164
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:52,250
I wish to share my cultivation insights with you all.

165
00:11:57,480 --> 00:12:00,250
I didn't expect you to send an avatar,

166
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,650
it's an honor.

167
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,090
How could I not come

168
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,370
to your once in 10 000 years birthday !

169
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,370
This little weasel...

170
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,850
I arrived in a hurry

171
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:19,530
so couldn't prepare any good gifts.

172
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,370
I know you like things with seven colors.

173
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:21,250
Sun Zhongan
Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance

174
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:23,690
This sword is an upper middle grade celestial artifact.

175
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,050
Its golden color

176
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,690
should suit your taste.

177
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,650
Kunpeng Zi,

178
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,410
your cultivation has made great progress lately.

179
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:37,130
I bestow this sword to you.

180
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,650
Thank you Master !

181
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,850
Your attitude

182
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,810
still hasn't changed !

183
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,090
This is a Star-Marked Weasel,

184
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,850
a pet that loves Ancient Gods.

185
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:54,770
Could it have sensed the faint Ancient God aura on me ?

186
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,090
The Dao of Heavenly Fate

187
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,130
is infinitely profound.

188
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,610
Fellow cultivators,

189
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,730
if you have doubts, please ask me.

190
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,410
The Heaveny Art

191
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:13,130
is about seeing the 99 cycles as one origin.

192
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,850
The first step

193
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,730
from Qi Condensation

194
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,850
all the way to Ascendant

195
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,730
is cultivation.

196
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,450
The second step

197
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,890
from Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang

198
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:28,170
to the 3 stages of Nirvana Shattering

199
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:33,290
is the transition between cultivation and the Dao.

200
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,370
And the third step

201
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,970
is the true essence of the Dao.

202
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:40,930
Sadly, even I haven't comprehended it yet.

203
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,650
My Dao of Heavenly Fate is:

204
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,170
if that if you are fated,

205
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,970
you can achieve anything.

206
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:49,010
But if you are not fated,

207
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:51,170
10 000 years of cultivation

208
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,850
will not amount to anything.

209
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,850
If what the All-Seer says is true

210
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,370
then I haven't even finished the first step.

211
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,250
But does the third step

212
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,850
even exist ?

213
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,650
Wang Lin,

214
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:13,330
do you have any questions ?

215
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,970
Master,

216
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,970
disciple indeed has a question.

217
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,050
Speak up.

218
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,130
On the path of cultivation

219
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,570
I have heard of 3 terms.

220
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,610
Cultivating immortality,

221
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,570
cultivating truth,

222
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,410
cultivating the Dao.

223
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:27,050
Why does Master only refer to it as cultivating the Dao

224
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,250
and not the others ?

225
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:30,250
A good question.

226
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,610
The Celestials are gone.

227
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,050
Cultivating immortality came from the ancient celestials.

228
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:40,250
The Celestial Realm was the holy land of cultivation back then.

229
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,330
Hence the saying "cultivating immortality".

230
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,890
The "truth" in "cultivating truth"

231
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,370
is the source of everything.

232
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,250
After the Celestial Realm shattered,

233
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,930
cultivators were like trees without roots.

234
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:55,450
Homeless and drifting in the void.

235
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:58,930
That's how "cultivating truth" became the core of cultivation.

236
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,610
And now,

237
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:04,890
both immortality and truth are things of the past.

238
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,770
What we seek is the Dao.

239
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,170
But this kind of Dao

240
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,450
is not the Dao of the heavens.

241
00:15:13,570 --> 00:15:16,370
How can you cultivate the Dao but not follow the Dao of the heavens ?

242
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,930
Then what is the Dao ?

243
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,370
The "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao"

244
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,050
is a path, a direction.

245
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,930
Because we don't know what the third step is,

246
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:30,650
we are looking for a path to reach it.

247
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,210
This

248
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:35,690
is what the "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao" means.

249
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,370
Wang Lin,

250
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,530
does that answer your question ?

251
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,850
Disciple wonders

252
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,970
if the third step even exists.

253
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,250
30 000 years ago,

254
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:49,570
I met a person

255
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:52,250
who had already reached the third step.

256
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:55,690
Unfortunately, he only appeared for a short time

257
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:58,930
and then disappeared.

258
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,970
Master,

259
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,450
disciple also has a question.

260
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,250
Master,

261
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,810
disciple has a question.

262
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,730
3 days later

263
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,850
Is everyone satisfied

264
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:23,490
after these 3 days of lecture ?

265
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:31,530
Old man All-Seer,

266
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:36,090
how could I not come to your birthday !?

267
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,730
It's Sword Saint Ling Tianhou !

268
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,690
It's Ling Tianhou !

269
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,410
It's him !

270
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,450
Why did he come ?

271
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:44,730
Why is Ling Tianhou here ?

272
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,250
Disciples,

273
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:49,770
come pay respects to Senior All-Seer !

274
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,770
Old man All-Seer,

275
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,970
so...

276
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,130
why aren't you welcoming me ?

277
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,890
How could I not ?

278
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:05,250
I was just preparing to demonstrate a middle grade celestial spell.

279
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,610
You

280
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,490
have come at the right time.

281
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:12,370
Now,

282
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:16,130
I will target you with this celestial spell

283
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:19,570
and let everyone present observe it.

284
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,050
What do you think ?

285
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,530
Why not ?

286
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,890
Fellow cultivators,

287
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:31,290
this is the middle grade Celestial Guidance Spell.

288
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:33,330
It was used by ancient celestials

289
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:36,650
to send cultivators like us to the Celestial Realm.

290
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,450
Everyone,

291
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:41,170
pay close attention.

292
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,650
Celestial Gate,

293
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:45,050
open !

294
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,150
This spell...

295
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:07,250
it's disrupting my celestial spiritual energy.

296
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,650
Somehow the golden celestial spiritual energy is not affected !

297
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:18,450
Guidance !

298
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,050
All-Seer,

299
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,970
you...

300
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:50,050
I am the Celestial Realm's Eternal Envoy,

301
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:54,170
I am here to guide you cultivators from lower realms.

302
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,850
Old man All-Seer...

303
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,850
The Celestial Realm is no more !

304
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,890
Where did your Celestial Guidance Spell

305
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:16,010
send all my disciples !?

306
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:19,050
Sword Saint, don't worry.

307
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:22,570
They will return here in 3 days.

308
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:27,170
At that time, I will need to borrow a few of your disciples

309
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:30,570
to ask them what they saw.

310
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:34,970
Qilin,

311
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,410
come back !

312
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:40,850
Old man All-Seer,

313
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:42,370
3 months from now

314
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:44,610
bring the people you have chosen

315
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:46,370
to the East Demon Spirit Sea.

316
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,450
I have one more thing

317
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:53,090
that I want everyone to see.

318
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:56,730
Among my 7 divisions of the Heavenly Fate Sect,

319
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:58,930
the Yellow and Violet divisions

320
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:01,970
still don't have Sons of Tian Yun.

321
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,730
Today

322
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,370
is the day of the competition

323
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:11,450
for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

324
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,170
Are you all

325
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:17,450
ready to begin ?

326
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:33,250
I've been walking this path for endless years

327
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:33,250
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

328
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:38,850
Is it the compass of fate

329
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,850
that wrote this outcome for us ?

330
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:44,770
The heavens want to erase your existence,

331
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:50,490
that's the obsession guiding me.

332
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:56,090
Is this the path to uncover

333
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:56,090
truths from falsehoods ?

334
00:20:56,120 --> 00:21:01,690
In a world of murk and shadow,

335
00:20:58,020 --> 00:21:01,690
only the flame of truth can light the way.

336
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:07,410
Look at them all,

337
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:07,410
being carried by the waves.

338
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:12,050
Look at them all,

339
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:12,050
being drowned.

340
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:15,370
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

341
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:18,450
I will let the world refine my soul.

342
00:21:18,330 --> 00:21:24,010
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

343
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:24,010
I will fight.

344
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:27,130
I'll break through the abyss of despair

345
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:30,170
to finally learn who I really am.

346
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:35,530
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

347
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:35,530
I embrace this obsession.

348
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:38,490
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

349
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:41,290
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

350
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:46,770
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

351
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:46,770
I'll still fight.

352
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:50,130
It's hard to avoid loneliness

353
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:53,170
when you are above everyone else.

354
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:58,850
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

355
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:58,850
be afraid of a firefly ?
